    person("GPT-6.2 Astra", role = "ctb", comment = "Development assistance"))
Description: Follows exact comparisons in a deterministic multilevel Louvain
    algorithm across the requested nonnegative resolution range. Detects
    connected components, reuses certified decisions at adjacent resolutions,
    searches disjoint intervals in parallel and stores distinct partitions
    and their resolution intervals in a Seurat object's tools slot. Ranks the
    final partitions by classical Newman-Girvan modularity and reports
    the earliest resolution attaining its maximum when a minimum exists.
